\begin_inset Formula $\sum_{i=0}^{2}a_{i}f(x_{0}+\theta_{i}h)=\frac{3}{4}h\cdot f(x_{0})+0\cdot f(x_{0}+h)+\frac{9}{4}h\cdot f(x_{0}+2h)$
\end_inset

